  <h1>Lesson 13: Text Styling in CSS</h1>
  <p>Learn font-size, font-family, font-weight, text-align, line-height, letter-spacing, text-decoration | LearnHTMLCSSJS.com</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="tabs">
    <button id="lessonTabBtn" class="tab-btn active" onclick="showLesson()">📖 Lesson</button>
    <button id="testTabBtn" class="tab-btn" onclick="showTest()">📝 Test - 100 Marks</button>
  </div>
  <div id="lockMsg" class="lock-msg">🔒 Test is running! All tabs are locked until you submit the test or time ends.</div>

  <div id="lessonContent">
    <h2>1. All Text Properties - Learn This Table</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Property</th><th>What it Changes</th><th>Example</th></tr>
      <tr><td>font-size</td><td>Size of text</td><td>16px, 20px, 30px</td></tr>
      <tr><td>font-family</td><td>Style / Font of text</td><td>Arial, Georgia, Verdana</td></tr>
      <tr><td>font-weight</td><td>Bold or Normal</td><td>normal, bold, 700</td></tr>
      <tr><td>text-align</td><td>Left, Center, Right</td><td>left, center, right</td></tr>
      <tr><td>line-height</td><td>Gap between lines</td><td>1.5, 1.7, 30px</td></tr>
      <tr><td>letter-spacing</td><td>Gap between letters</td><td>1px, 2px</td></tr>
      <tr><td>text-decoration</td><td>Underline, None</td><td>underline, none</td></tr>
      <tr><td>text-transform</td><td>UPPERCASE, lowercase</td><td>uppercase, lowercase, capitalize</td></tr>
    </table>
    <h2>2. font-size - Size of Text</h2>
    <p>Normal paragraph = <b>16px</b>. Heading = <b>28px to 40px</b>. Small text = <b>13px to 14px</b>.</p>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">h1</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-size</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">32px</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="tag">p</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-size</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">18px</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="tag">small</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-size</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">13px</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><p style="font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin:0">Heading - 32px</p><p style="font-size:18px;margin:5px 0">Paragraph - 18px</p><p style="font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#64748b">Small text - 13px</p></div>
    <h2>3. font-family - Style of Text</h2>
    <p>font-family changes the look of the text. Always write 2-3 fonts - if first font is not available, browser will use second one.</p>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">h1</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-family</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">Arial, sans-serif</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="tag">p</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-family</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">Georgia, serif</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><p style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;margin:0">This is Arial - Clean and Modern</p><p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;margin:8px 0 0">This is Georgia - Classic and Stylish</p><p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:20px;margin:8px 0 0">This is Courier New - Code Style</p><p style="font-family:Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:20px;margin:8px 0 0">This is Verdana - Easy to Read</p></div>
    <h2>4. font-weight & font-style</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">b</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-weight</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">bold</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* 700 = bold */</span><br>
<span class="tag">p</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-weight</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">normal</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* 400 = normal */</span><br>
<span class="tag">i</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">font-style</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">italic</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><p style="font-weight:normal;margin:0">Normal - font-weight: normal;</p><p style="font-weight:bold;margin:5px 0">Bold - font-weight: bold;</p><p style="font-weight:900;margin:0">Extra Bold - font-weight: 900;</p><p style="font-style:italic;margin:5px 0 0">Italic - font-style: italic;</p></div>
    <h2>5. text-align - Left, Center, Right</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">h1</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">text-align</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">center</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="tag">p</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">text-align</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">right</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><p style="text-align:left;margin:0">Left - text-align: left; (Default)</p><p style="text-align:center;margin:5px 0;font-weight:bold">Center - text-align: center;</p><p style="text-align:right;margin:0">Right - text-align: right;</p><p style="text-align:justify;margin:5px 0 0">Justify - text-align: justify; - This text fills the full width from left to right, like a newspaper. Both sides look straight.</p></div>
    <h2>6. line-height, letter-spacing & word-spacing</h2>
    <p><b>line-height</b> = Gap between lines. Good value is <b>1.6 or 1.7</b> for paragraphs.<br><b>letter-spacing</b> = Gap between letters.<br><b>word-spacing</b> = Gap between words.</p>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">p</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">line-height</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">1.7</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="attr">letter-spacing</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">1px</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><p style="line-height:1.2;margin:0">Tight - line-height: 1.2 - Lines are close. Hard to read. This is not good for long paragraphs.</p><p style="line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0 0">Good - line-height: 1.8 - Lines have good gap. Easy to read. Always use 1.6 to 1.8 for paragraphs.</p><p style="letter-spacing:4px;margin:10px 0 0;font-weight:bold">LETTER SPACING - 4px</p><p style="word-spacing:15px;margin:5px 0 0">Word Spacing - 15px gap</p></div>
    <h2>7. text-decoration & text-transform</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">a</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">text-decoration</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">none</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span> <span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">/* Removes underline from link */</span><br>
<span class="tag">h1</span> <span class="text">{</span> <span class="attr">text-transform</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">uppercase</span><span class="text">;</span> <span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><p style="margin:0"><a href="#" style="text-decoration:none;color:#2563eb;font-weight:bold">Link with NO underline - text-decoration: none;</a></p><p style="margin:8px 0;text-decoration:underline">Underline - text-decoration: underline;</p><p style="margin:0;text-decoration:line-through;color:#64748b">Line Through - text-decoration: line-through;</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:bold">Uppercase - text-transform: uppercase;</p><p style="margin:0;text-transform:capitalize">Capitalize - text-transform: capitalize; (First Letter Capital)</p><p style="margin:5px 0 0;text-transform:lowercase">LOWERCASE - text-transform: lowercase;</p></div>
    <h2>8. Full Example - Beautiful Heading + Paragraph</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">&lt;style&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">h1</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">font-size</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">36px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">font-family</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">Arial, sans-serif</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">font-weight</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">bold</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">text-align</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">center</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">color</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">#0f172a</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">}</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">p</span> <span class="text">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">font-size</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">18px</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">line-height</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">1.7</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">text-align</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">center</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="attr">color</span><span class="text">:</span> <span class="val">#64748b</span><span class="text">;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">}</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;/style&gt;</span>
    </code></div>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b><h2 style="font-size:36px;text-align:center;color:#0f172a;margin:0">Welcome to My Website</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;text-align:center;color:#64748b;margin:8px 0 0">I am Ali. I am learning HTML and CSS. I will become a web developer.</p></div>
    <h2>9. Homework - Practice for 2 Minutes</h2>
    <p>In Playground, make this:</p>
    <p>1. One <b>h1</b> - font-size 36px, text-align center, text-transform uppercase<br>2. One <b>p</b> - font-size 18px, line-height 1.7, font-family Arial<br>3. One <b>a</b> link - text-decoration none, color blue</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> font-size = Size | font-family = Font style | font-weight = bold / normal | text-align = left / center / right / justify | line-height = Gap between lines (1.7 is best) | letter-spacing = Gap between letters | text-decoration = none / underline | text-transform = uppercase / lowercase / capitalize</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> After this lesson, go to <a href="/lesson14">Lesson 14 - Box Model</a> to learn padding, border, margin - the most important CSS concept.</p>
    <a id="playgroundLink" class="btn" href="/playground">▶ Try it Yourself - Playground</a><br><br>
